		<link href="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2426&amp;p=20122#p20122"/>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[OpenGD77CPS success on linux/wine (codeplug r/w confirmed)]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=2426&amp;p=20122#p20122"><![CDATA[
I'll assume wine already up and running, CPS already installed somewhere in $WINEPREFIX, udev rules and groups setup correctly.<br><br>Connect device to your machine, run wineboot once, go to your actual $WINEPREFIX/dosdevices and find actual COM-port:<div class="codebox"><p>CODE: </p><pre><code>$ wineboot$ LC_ALL=C ls -la .wine/dosdevices/com*| grep ACMlrwxrwxrwx 1 ilyxa ilyxa 12 Oct 16 20:11 .wine/dosdevices/com33 -&gt; /dev/ttyACM0</code></pre></div><div class="codebox"><p>CODE: </p><pre><code>wine reg add "HKLM\System\CurrentControlSet\Enum\SERIAL\COM33\COM33" /v ClassGUID /t REG_SZ /d {4D36E978-E325-11CE-BFC1-08002BE10318}wine reg add "HKLM\System\CurrentControlSet\Enum\SERIAL\COM33\COM33" /v FriendlyName /t REG_SZ /d "OpenGD77 (COM33)"</code></pre></div>Run:<div class="codebox"><p>CODE: </p><pre><code>wine .wine/drive_c/OpenGD77CPS/OpenGD77CPS.exe</code></pre></div>Read/write codeplug - DONE.<br><br><br>PS:<div class="codebox"><p>CODE: </p><pre><code>$ trizen -Q wine-staging wine-monowine-staging 7.18-1wine-mono 7.3.0-1</code></pre></div><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=3128">UB6LUM</a> — Sun Oct 16, 2022 5:19 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
